; Run-Start - Doom 3 port, phase 3: the first start on the A1200 (PLAN.md
; section 8). The game initialises everything (file system, renderer and its
; GLSL programs, game code), then quits. Watch the screen: a 640x480 screen
; opens for a moment.
;   CD to this directory, then:   Execute Run-Start
;   Other game data:               Execute Run-Start DATA=<directory with demo/ or base/>
;   Extra console commands:        Execute Run-Start CMD="+map game/demo_mars_city1 +wait 100"
; Output goes to results/ (the console log, the memory before and after).
.key DATA/K,CMD/K
.def DATA "Stuff:doom3"
.def CMD ""
.bra {
.ket }

FailAt 21
If NOT EXISTS dhewm3
  Echo "Please CD into the start directory first, then run:  Execute Run-Start"
  Quit 20
EndIf
MakeDir results >NIL:
Avail FLUSH >NIL:
Avail >results/avail-before.txt
List LIBS:ogles2#? >results/libs.txt
List libs >>results/libs.txt
Stack 9000000

Echo "Doom 3: start, initialise, quit (data in {DATA})"
dhewm3 +set fs_basepath "{DATA}" +set s_noSound 1 +set image_usePrecompressedTextures 1 +set r_fullscreen 1 +set r_mode -1 +set r_customWidth 640 +set r_customHeight 480 {CMD} +quit >results/stdout.txt
Echo "exit code $RC" >>results/stdout.txt
Copy save/dhewm3log.txt results/ QUIET
Avail FLUSH >NIL:
Avail >results/avail-after.txt
Type results/stdout.txt
